    D: "YOUR FIRST 100 STEPS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>The present tense of a verb will most often end in -R, learn to recognise it.</p>Also, note that <b class=\"bold\">double consonants</b> (in this case MM) are mostly pronounced with a <b class=\"bold\">longer sound</b> (think of \"rooMMate\" or \"miDDay\" in English).</div></div>",
