    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>The Norwegian equivalent of the singular definite article \"the\" goes at the end of the word it refers to.</p>This will be -EN (or -N) for masculine gender words, or -ET (or -T) for neuter gender words.</div></div>",
