    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\">Most nouns belonging to the <span class=\"italic\">hankj\xf8nn</span> gender (i.e. masculine) would end in ER or R for the indefinite plural form, but <span class=\"italic\">takk</span> is an exception and doesn't change.</div></div>",
    A: "N"
