    E: "<div class=\"center\">1</div>",
    D: "BASIC NUMBERS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>While <span class=\"italic\">en</span> and <span class=\"italic\">et</span> translate to \"a/an\", <span class=\"italic\">\xe9n</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ett</span> translate to \"one\", changing according to the gender of the noun they refer to.</p>When counting, <span class=\"italic\">\xe9n</span> is used:<br><span class=\"italic\">\xe9n, to, tre, fire</span></div></div>",
