    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>The other three forms are:</p><p><span class=\"italic\">gutten</span>&emsp;(the boy)<br><span class=\"italic\">gutter</span>&emsp;(boys)<br><span class=\"italic\">guttene</span>&emsp;(the boys)</p>The variation <span class=\"italic\">gutta</span> is sometimes used for \"the boys\".</div></div>",
