    E: "<div class=\"center\">to like<br>liked<br>have liked</div>",
    D: "TOP 40 VERBS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>Note that the expression \"to like very much\" is <span class=\"italic\">\xe5 like veldig godt</span> (i.e. to like very well):</p><span class=\"italic\">Jeg liker pizza veldig godt</span></div></div>",
    A: "N"
