    N: "<div class=\"center\">\xe5 dra<br>drar<br>dro<br>har dratt</div>",
    E: "<div class=\"center\"><p>to go, went, have gone<br>(by any means other than walking),</p>to leave, left, have left</div>",
    D: "TOP 40 VERBS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>The verb <span class=\"italic\">\xe5 dra</span> must be used for \"going somewhere\" by means other than walking:<br><span class=\"italic\">Vi dro til Spania i oktober</span>.</p>It would be wrong to say:<br><span class=\"italic\">Vi gikk til Spania i oktober</span>.</div></div>",
