    D: "TOP 40 VERBS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p><span class=\"italic\">\xe5 vente</span> often requires the preposition <span class=\"italic\">p\xe5</span>:</p><p>Wait for me!</p><span class=\"italic\">Vent p\xe5 meg!</span></div></div>",
