    D: "TOP 40 VERBS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>This verb can be used if the subject is a thing.</p><p><span class=\"italic\">Hva betyr ordet \"dugnad\"?</span><br>What does the word \"dugnad\" mean?</p>When people mean something, you must use <span class=\"italic\">\xe5 mene, mener, mente, har ment</span>.</div></div>",
