    E: "<div class=\"center\"><p>to know, knew, have known</p>(in the sense of being acquainted with somebody)</div>",
    D: "TOP 40 VERBS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p><span class=\"italic\">Jeg kjenner en venn av deg</span></p> <p>Remember that the sound of KJ is <span class=\"italic\">similar</span> to the <b class=\"bold\">H</b> in \"<b class=\"bold\">h</b>ue\" and \"<b class=\"bold\">h</b>uge\".</p> This is NOT the same sound as SKJ and SJ.</div></div>",
    A: "N"
