    D: "TELLING TIME",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>Very specific times (e.g. train times) are most often expressed with the number for the hours and the number for the minutes.</p>Alternatively, this could be said as <span class=\"italic\">fjorten p\xe5 tolv</span>.</div></div>",
