    E: "<div class=\"center\">et sentrum<br>sentrumet<br>sentre<br>sentrene</div>",
    D: "INTERMEDIATE NOUNS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>Nouns ending in -UM come from Latin and are all <span class=\"italic\">intetkj\xf8nn</span>.<br>They may have less used forms, different from those shown.</p>Note that <span class=\"italic\">et senter</span> is a different word altogether.</div></div>",
