    D: "INTERMEDIATE NOUNS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><span class=\"italic\">Hankj\xf8nn</span> nouns ending in -ER (in the indefinite singular form) will often drop E (if unstressed) for the plural forms.</div></div>",
    A: "E"
