    D: "INTERMEDIATE ADJECTIVES",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>Adjectives specifying order and position in a <span class=\"italic\">bestemt</span> context can be used with or without the determiner (before) and the end article (on the noun they refer to). Some of the most used are:</p><p><span class=\"italic\">midtre, nedre, siste, forrige, neste</span></p>The last two are in fact considered determiners.</div></div>",
    A: "E"
