    D: "NUMBERS & ORDINALS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>When the \"unofficial\" reading starts with <span class=\"italic\">fire</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\xe5tte</span>, the final E of either these unit numbers is not pronounced.</p><span class=\"italic\">\xe5tteogtretti</span> is read as if it was <span class=\"italic\">\xe5ttogtretti</span></div></div>",
