    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>Remember that \"how long\" translates as <span class=\"italic\">hvor lenge</span>, not as <span class=\"italic\">hvordan lenge</span>.</p><p><span class=\"italic\">Hvor lenge var du der?</span></p>You can also use <span class=\"italic\">hvor lang tid</span>.</div></div>",
