    D: "ADVERBS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p><span class=\"italic\">Jeg er nesten ferdig</span></p><p><span class=\"italic\">Han hadde nesten glemt bursdagen min!</span></p>Do not confuse <span class=\"italic\">nesten</span> with <span class=\"italic\">neste</span> (which means \"next\").</div></div>",
    A: "N"
