    N: "<div class=\"center\">borte, bort</div>",
    E: "<div class=\"center\">away</div>",
    D: "ADVERBS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p><span class=\"italic\">Borte</span> refers to a static position, <span class=\"italic\">bort</span> entails movement from one place to another. See the difference:</p><p><span class=\"italic\">Vi er borte hjemmefra</span></p><span class=\"italic\">Vi reiser bort neste uke</span></div></div>",
    A: "N"
