    E: "<div class=\"center\">this month</div>",
    D: "ADVERBS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\">Unlike <span class=\"italic\">dag</span>, <span class=\"italic\">uke</span> and <span class=\"italic\">\xe5r</span>, the current instance of the month is indicated with <span class=\"italic\">denne</span> rather than <span class=\"italic\">i</span>.</div></div>",
