    D: "PREPOSITIONS IN USE",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p><span class=\"italic\">Mellom</span> is used with <span class=\"italic\">bestemt</span> and measurable differences, <span class=\"italic\">p\xe5</span> is used with <span class=\"italic\">ubestemt</span> and significant differences in nature:</p><p><span class=\"italic\">Forskjellen mellom h\xf8ydene v\xe5re er liten</span></p><span class=\"italic\">Ser du forskjellen p\xe5 baseball og softball?</span></div></div>",
    A: "E"
