    E: "<div class=\"center\">Ingunn<b class=\"bold\">s</b> bok</div>",
    D: "COMPLEMENTS",
    X: "<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"left\"><p>One of the options to communicate belonging and possession is the S at the end of the name.<br>No apostrophe is needed unless the noun itself ends in S or an S-like sound:</p><span class=\"italic\">Marx' skrifter</span></div></div>",
    A: "E"
